### HeroScript Math API - Test Requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5260/api

### Get all formulas
GET {{baseUrl}}/formula

### Get specific formula
GET {{baseUrl}}/formula/HYPERBOLIC_CURVE

### Evaluate formula with default params
POST {{baseUrl}}/formula/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formulaName": "HYPERBOLIC_CURVE",
  "inputValue": 50
}

### Evaluate formula with param overrides
POST {{baseUrl}}/formula/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formulaName": "HYPERBOLIC_CURVE",
  "inputValue": 50,
  "paramOverrides": {
    "a": 100,
    "b": 2,
    "c": 10
  }
}

### Get all operations
GET {{baseUrl}}/math/expression/operations

### Evaluate custom expression
POST {{baseUrl}}/math/expression/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initialValue": 10,
  "steps": [
    {
      "operation": "MULTIPLY",
      "values": [2]
    },
    {
      "operation": "ADD",
      "values": [5]
    },
    {
      "operation": "POW",
      "values": [2]
    }
  ]
}

### Reload formula cache
POST {{baseUrl}}/formula/reload
